    "_unionWhy": "The row is overwritten whole because settings.db KV has no append, so two windows acknowledging different features inside one round trip would let the later write clobber the earlier one and lose an acknowledgement the user already made. Union is correct here ONLY because the ledger is append-only: no code path removes an id, so merging cannot revive anything. A ledger that gained a 'forget this hint' action would need a tombstone instead.",
