          "a"
        ],
        "otherAfter": [
          "b"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "guide": {
    "_why": "The guide is remembered by guide id plus revision, both named by the control plane: which release gets an announcement (patch included) and whether a corrected re-publish shows again are ops decisions, never client version arithmetic. Re-publishing the same id and revision stays dismissed; bumping the revision re-shows it; a new id always shows.",
